{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-d3ae903678d4fb93cfbd","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"사장, 보이나? 시필드 시티에 비가 내리고 있어","speaker":"엄브렐라","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4980025510246444320"],"speakerHashCandidates":["13332997875881088302","4685626022906033765","5559990424017843579"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-5098e78fdcf44a318047","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"완전 맑은 날씨 아니에요?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["9639481510876293507"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-dfb34a83945e0dafff99","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"내 머리 위를 봐. 계속 비가 내리고 있지?","speaker":"엄브렐라","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6886166038716939267"],"speakerHashCandidates":["13332997875881088302","4685626022906033765","5559990424017843579"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-82a8208120080294dd79","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"우산에 비가 필요한 것처럼, 너구리가 말썽을 피워야 하는 것처럼… 아 아니, 책에 시가 필요한 것처럼 말이야","speaker":"엄브렐라","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14456100953388986652"],"speakerHashCandidates":["13332997875881088302","4685626022906033765","5559990424017843579"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-a8d7c602d8909d03dfbc","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"맞아요, 바나나가 방금 사람을 죽였어요","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2238966180276499438"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-601970365d456a5823c8","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"오, 너도 들었어? 그 옛날 죽음의 전령이 죽인 사람보다 더 많대! 악랄한 바나나 회사!","speaker":"엄브렐라","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3461177352941881413"],"speakerHashCandidates":["13332997875881088302","4685626022906033765","5559990424017843579"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-5e86e3dbeb95d24c64d0","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"취재를… 아니, 피해자들이 고소하는 걸 도우려 했는데, 온갖 방법으로 방해하더라고. 참 무서운 세상이야","speaker":"엄브렐라","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15299010624980193591"],"speakerHashCandidates":["13332997875881088302","4685626022906033765","5559990424017843579"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-a35e3bca5b8844e724a7","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"변호사님, 문예 청년이셨어요?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["16200248734098546293"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-89ce6fb0783a0393b70b","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"변호사는 왜 문예 청년이면 안 되는 건데? 왕년엔 말이야, 내가 하룻밤에 10만 자 분량의 문학 평론 원고를 써서 낙원 C저널에 발표하기도 했다고. 아, 아니지. 또 직업병이 도졌네, 내가 왜 원고를 써야 해?","speaker":"엄브렐라","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10327358918740941111"],"speakerHashCandidates":["13332997875881088302","4685626022906033765","5559990424017843579"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-027523e5720879d48783","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"잠깐, 너 진짜 엄브렐라야?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2270574447865456433"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-7bb39ec4cdd8faaa9346","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"히히, 들켰네. 나 너구리 안 할래! 나는 「안너구리!」야!","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3314982922473528701"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-c3aa3dda47c656aa61e2","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"에휴휴, 너구리의 능력에는 한계가 있어. 아무리 「변신」을 해도 결국 교활한 인간들에게 들키고 말지. 하지만 변호사처럼 화려한 말솜씨로 「변론」을 펼치면 이상 낙원의 법 조항으로도 허점을 잡을 수 없다구리!","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15548404656020150754"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-4f96c670f999b5884e69","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"자, 사장님, 오늘 이 「안너구리」가 나의 극한을 보여주지!","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1387472752350078307"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-5f7171cc13908cc150d7","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"아… 몸도 다 못 풀었는데, 벌써 사장님한테 지다니……","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5379066489808293763"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-55fdc2d662de48490032","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"왜 꼭 싸워야만 해?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["11774121879887416946"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b5b738e62587064b7063","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"원래는 몸이나 좀 풀까 했는데… 그 우산 머리 변호사, 싸움 꽤나 한다고 하지 않았어?","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["40185315269375608"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-26ef90bc61e1de0fb8a6","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"너구리치고는 나쁘지 않네","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["7436973220020295719"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-37c82f3e6f8c96c9eb47","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"정말? 칭찬 고마워, 사장님!","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10854293635449348605"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-80eead24d43054c1e454","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"그래서 우산 머리는 왜 단 거야?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["5942725865007371453"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-7e25c37066997bea300a","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"그 사람 모습이 엄청 멋지거든구리! 그리고 말이야……","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16731147764574323181"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-d3ddbec78682ff764da5","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"능숙해지면, 다음에 잡지사에 또 무슨 문제가 생겼을 때… 내가 그 사람으로 변장해서 시비 거는 녀석들을 겁줄 수 있잖아!","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7745697394982096104"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-ac4da02cfebc661825f5","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"괜찮아. 그 불성실한 사람들은 원래 변호사를 무서워하잖아…. 게다가 변호사 중에서는 우산 머리가 제일 유명하고","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17886838595701613364"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-c33f04e56b54232a8299","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"변신을 이렇게도 쓸 수 있다고?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["15491230033946148293"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b4010f794300d48ec102","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"당연하지. 사장님은 리리들이 잡지사 생각은 전혀 안 한다고 생각하는 거야? 섭섭하네","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10847792629353121702"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-abeeab850bc0170070e0","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"알겠어, 다음엔 너만 믿을게!","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14323230422411103223"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-64005b6a020fc6da7269","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"맡겨 줘! 그 불성실한 사람들은 원래 변호사를 무서워하잖아…. 게다가 변호사 중에서는 우산 머리가 제일 유명하고","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15891502135449310434"],"speakerHashCandidates":["854647631569654477"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-d6f27db910394f0efb98","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s59ae7fff2b1fe792","text":"사장님 몸조심해. 나는 계속 정진해서 진짜 변호사가 되어 돌아올게!","speaker":"안너구리!","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"안너구리!","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["141114347743